{"id":62164,"mal_id":62164,"title":"Akane-banashi","englishTitle":"Akane-banashi","title_english":"Akane-banashi","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":[],"en":"Akane-banashi","ja":"あかね噺"},"synopsis":"From a young age, Akane Ousaki has always loved to watch her father, Tooru, practice and perform rakugo, a form of traditional Japanese comedic storytelling. Rakugo performers are split into three ranks, with the highest, shinuchi, only granted to the very best performers after they pass a difficult promotion test. When Tooru takes the exam, Akane experiences her father putting on a stellar performance in front of a big crowd and judges, but the strict main judge, Isshou Arakawa, still fails him, forcing him to quit rakugo.\n\nEver since, Akane has been diligently practicing rakugo herself. Now a senior in high school, she coincidentally lands a spot to perform in front of a crowd with the help of Shiguma Arakawa, Tooru's former teacher. Her splendid performance surprises everyone and is just the beginning: Shiguma appoints her as his new apprentice, and with his help, Akane sets out to become a shinuchi in her father's place.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":null,"type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1490,"average_episode_duration":1490,"startDate":"2026-04-04","start_date":"2026-04-04","endDate":"2026-06-20","end_date":"2026-06-20","season":"spring","year":2026,"start_season":{"year":2026,"season":"spring"},"episodes":12,"num_episodes":12,"score":7.93,"mean":7.93,"numListUsers":81202,"num_list_users":81202,"genres":[{"id":8,"name":"Drama"},{"id":70,"name":"Performing Arts"},{"id":27,"name":"Shounen"}],"studios":[{"id":218,"name":"Zexcs"}],"pictures":["https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1742/151286l.webp","https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1041/155129l.webp","https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1162/155669l.webp"],"backdrop_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/tD1pMgt3DNGoJn2M0QaDyaN3FfJ.jpg",